    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>愈沉默愈有力量</span></p><span></span><p><span>强烈不安 灵魂震荡</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由且奔放&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许，还有一分强烈的纯粹</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>1999年《Silence》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;骄傲摧毁的--Silence</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;直接不委婉的--那天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;烈酒味道的--Monster</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;爱而不得的--我给的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;任意玩票的--静止</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;惊鸿一瞥的--固执</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;昙花一现的--固执（陈珊妮）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2001年《应该》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;回溯重来的--应该</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> &nbsp;清浅独白的--祝我幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span>2006年《女爵》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">37:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;安静空寂的--我离开我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;肤浅质疑的--女爵</span></p><span></span><p><span>2009年《Self-Sleced》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;温暖且独特的--Hallelujah</span></p><span></span><p><span>2013年《Zero》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2676">44:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;归零初始的--未接来电</span></p><span></span><p><span>2016年《离心力》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;温柔与爱的--推开世界的门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">48:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;粉碎完整的--离心力</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023年《Flow》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3219">53:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;摇滚纽斯的--说不出口 feat.伍佰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3318">55:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;独具一格的--思绪的尽头 feat.啥子与白痴</span></p><span></span><p><span>1997年《One》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3498">58:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;固执坚持的--星星堆满天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a> &nbsp;个性独特的--你就是吃定我</span></p><span></span><p><span>彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3837">63:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;祝我幸福</span></p>]]></description>
