    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>音乐是最美好调味剂</span><br><span>自由且徜徉…</span><br><span>也许吧！</span><br><span>这就是人生</span><br><span>我们太过渺小，不值一提</span><br><span>心灵深处的某一个地方</span><br><span>总能听见不愿遗忘的话语</span><br><span>与其言尽心底的悲伤</span><br><span>不如轻声歌唱</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Ditto -- New Jeans </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;昴(すばる) -- 谷村新司</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;星 -- 邓丽君</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有谁共鸣 -- 谷村新司&amp;张国荣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;White Ferrari -- Frank Ocean</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;云也想念她 &nbsp;-- 水星</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Vincent -- David Roth</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Circle`Round the Sun -- Matthew E. White</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;WAP -- &nbsp;Cardi B feat. Megan Thee Stallion </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;凝望月亮 --张志林</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;God Is Woman -- Airana Grande</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Love Is Over -- 李健</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;分裂 -- 王菲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Blowin`in the Wind -- &nbsp;Bob Dylan</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;いつも何度でも -- 久石让/木村弓</span></p>]]></description>
